<title>USA: McRae says founder/CEO Branson McRae dies.</title>
<headline>McRae says founder/CEO Branson McRae dies.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNT GILEAD, N.C. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>McRae Industries Inc said on Thursday that Branson McRae, founder, president, chief executive and chairman of the board, has died.</p>
<p>The company named D. Gary McRae, who is the son of Branson McRae, chief executive.  </p>
<p>McRae was 77 and died of cancer, said company spokeswoman Lainey Maness.</p>
<p>A new president and chairman will be appointed next month at the next board meeting, Maness said.</p>
<p>The younger McRae is the leading contender for the offices, she said.</p>
</text>
